@base = http://localhost:8080

########## GET /api/rooms — list, with optional filters ##########

### 1. List all rooms (200)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms

### 2. Filter by minimum capacity (200)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms?minCapacity=15

### 3. Filter by keyword in the name (200)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms?keyword=room

### 4. Both filters together (200)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms?minCapacity=15&keyword=room

### 5. Filters that match nothing — empty list, still 200
GET {{base}}/api/rooms?minCapacity=15&keyword=nothing

### 6. minCapacity is not a number (400)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms?minCapacity=abc

########## GET /api/rooms/{id} — one room ##########

### 7. Get one room (200)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/1

### 8. Get a room that does not exist (404)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/999

########## POST /api/rooms — create ##########

### 9. Create a room (201 + Location: /api/rooms/3)
POST {{base}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Room C", "capacity": 8}

### 10. Create with capacity 0 — below the minimum (400)
POST {{base}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Too small", "capacity": 0}

### 11. Create with capacity 50 — above the maximum (400)
POST {{base}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Too big", "capacity": 50}

########## PUT /api/rooms/{id} — replace ##########

### 12. Replace an existing room (200)
PUT {{base}}/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Room A (renamed)", "capacity": 12}

### 13. Replace a room that does not exist (404)
PUT {{base}}/api/rooms/999
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Nope", "capacity": 10}

### 14. Replace with capacity 50 — above the maximum (400)
PUT {{base}}/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Room A", "capacity": 50}

########## DELETE /api/rooms/{id} ##########

### 15. Delete a room (204)
DELETE {{base}}/api/rooms/2

### 16. Delete a room that does not exist (404)
DELETE {{base}}/api/rooms/999
